  "$id": "urn:pulsemech:required-gate-idempotence-mapping-observation:v0",
  "title": "Fixed-probe cooperative stopped executable backing-object observation v0",
  "description": "Closed example-only selection, bounded kernel-observation capture, and independent record verification. A cooperative post-exec SIGSTOP is not a ptrace exec event. Backing-object evidence does not authenticate the host, resident memory, complete native closure, or selected runtime execution. Raw evidence and original selections must be independently reconstructed by the checker.",
